,"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"179"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to the disappearance of Savant Shironeko, he is currently working away from the Far East Branch.."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It seems that he believed in Shironeko, but he has a strained feeling towards the Savant in general. He is superficially polite but rude in intent."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c113228"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/0469e6f243510c7a673005cedce849591d575e8aed9d3bd65add3dac93d9fb7d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6a/6a57ee582e4ba106bee4f38262f865b7e643b817955cbe4f204e686806ea0428.webp","width":184,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"須藤 翔","creatorId":"vndb:s4816","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4816","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4816","name":"やじまのぼる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:80316","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c113229","characterName":"ミズカミ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c113229"},"originalCharacterName":"ミズカミ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"14"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Junior high school student and active fraudster."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although he is enrolled in a school in the capital, he has rarely been seen. He was recruited by Shironeko to become a Savant candidate, but after his disappearance, he began investigating the organization on his own."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c113229"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/38a13841064d7e9e197eb1aaf278fc36c90f3f018c2599aedde7ff95af342ae2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b645d6bad7d25c11ac19b962864f885209300f94223b6166dbaccc92e12421fc.webp","width":165,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"川辺 俊介","creatorId":"vndb:s10192","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10192","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10192","name":"宮中太一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:80318","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89026","characterName":"ユニ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89026"},"originalCharacterName":"ユニ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"330"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"174"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Discovered as a savant in an unusual way, hence why he's called a \"miracle.\" He was given special treatment at the European Headquarters and did not join the mission, but he was suddenly transferred to the Far East Branch.."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He hates troublesome and painful things, but loves women. He can't sleep until he feels another person's skin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He pities Manna, a junior savant, and thinks that he'd be useless without him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89026"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7a1556d1e3a7f71ba5e9348fdf29770fd43bc45476a40ffa25db7ecc1156b04b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/84d39a07c09ab5c84dcf98105c63f66d9e887663f02e4bbcec680bf22b45bbf1.webp","width":172,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林 裕介","creatorId":"vndb:s8317","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8317","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8317","name":"小林 裕介","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:80317","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89027","characterName":"ニジョウ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89027"},"originalCharacterName":"ニジョウ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"910"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"188"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Far East Branch Staff. He is ble to handle a wide range of tasks, from annihilating resistance forces to paperwork. He excels in both literary and military arts, and stands out among ordinary employees."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He doesn't show much emotion. Hhe calmly carries out his duties, and also calmly eats sweets."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He vowed to dedicate his \"life, body, and soul\" to Yuni."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89027"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/1557479e6f3641a00da8735aad2715a